# codes:
file "alterparam_reset.sp" deck
  title "alterparam_reset"
  comment " oracle: S3-CONTROL S1, S2: alterparam edits the deck and takes effect at the next reset (inp.c:1735-1857; settle/state_reset.sp, state_alterparam.sp); every reset is the IR's Reset of every class (A28), the waiting alterparams as parameter alters right before it"
  param p = 1k
  analysis op
  alter (param p) value=3k
  alter (param p) value=4k
  reset values options temp tnom saves
  analysis op
  reset values options temp tnom saves
  analysis op
